      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">How to Connect Apple Watch to a Treadmill</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        If the treadmill supports Apple GymKit, you tap your watch on the console and the two share data. Most home treadmills do not, and the better answer for them is an Indoor Run workout plus a little calibration.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
